#: kcmaccess.cpp:183
msgid "Audible Bell"
msgstr "Кўринадиган сигнал"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:190
msgid "Use &system bell"
msgstr "&Тизим товуш сигналидан фойдаланиш"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:192
msgid "Us&e customized bell"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:194
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. Normally, "
"this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:197
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound file. "
"If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell.<p> "
"Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the event "
"causing the bell and the sound being played."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:204
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "Ўйнаш учун &товуш:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:209
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound file "
"here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:226
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "Кўринадиган сигнал"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:232
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "Кўринадиган &сигналдан фойдаланиш"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:234
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:240
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:243
msgid ""
"All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:245
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:247
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:253
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:260
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "Давом этиши:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:261 kcmaccess.cpp:314 kcmaccess.cpp:332
msgid " msec"
msgstr " мс"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:263
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being shown."
msgstr ""

